1
00:00:04,405 --> 00:00:07,785
- Sheldon, can you grab me a water?
- Possibly.

2
00:00:08,784 --> 00:00:11,454
- Can you or can't you?
- It's not that simple, Leonard.

3
00:00:11,620 --> 00:00:14,040
(Leonard:)It never is, is it?

4
00:00:14,707 --> 00:00:17,167
(Sheldon:)At this moment,
our relationship exists...

5
00:00:17,334 --> 00:00:19,584
(Sheldon:)...in two mutually contradictory states.

6
00:00:19,753 --> 00:00:23,713
(Sheldon:)Until you either do not go
or go to wil Wheaton's party...

7
00:00:23,882 --> 00:00:27,132
...you are simuItaneously
my friend and not my friend.

8
00:00:29,013 --> 00:00:33,103
(Sheldon:)I'm characterizing this phenomenon
as Schrödinger's friendship.

9
00:00:35,394 --> 00:00:38,064
- Got it. Can I have my water?
- Yeah, of course.

10
00:00:38,230 --> 00:00:40,480
Now get it yourseIf, you traitor.

11
00:00:43,277 --> 00:00:45,907
- Wait, what is going on?
- ln case you have forgotten...

12
00:00:46,071 --> 00:00:49,411
- ...Schrödinger's cat is a thought...
- No, I didn't forget.

13
00:00:49,575 --> 00:00:52,455
(Penny:)Um, there's this cat in a box
and until you open it...

14
00:00:52,619 --> 00:00:54,579
(Penny:)...it's either dead or alive or both.

15
00:00:54,747 --> 00:00:57,707
AIthough our cat got stuck
in my brother's camp trunk...

16
00:00:57,875 --> 00:01:03,025
(Penny:)...and we did not need to open it to know
there was all kinds of dead cat in there.

